{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-095","published":"2026-08-12T17:53:15Z","modified":"2026-08-12T19:45:03.130763760Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-73475"],"details":"This module enables you to pay for Commerce transactions using Paypal.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently validate the transaction result in certain circumstances, allowing a malicious user to mark transactions placed without payment.\n\nThis vulnerability only affects sites using the Payflow Link payment gateway.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/commerce_paypal","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/commerce_paypal?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.12.0"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"< 1.12.0"}},{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"2.0.0"},{"fixed":"2.1.3"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":">= 2.0.0 < 2.1.3"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"< 1.12.0 || >= 2.0.0 < 2.1.3","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/commerce_paypal/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-095.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-095"}],"credits":[{"name":"Kimberley Massey (kimberleycgm)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/kimberleycgm"]}]}